<title>RUSSIA: Russian GUM retailer 9-month '96 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Russian GUM retailer 9-month '96 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months ended September 30 --</p>
<p>							1996	   1995</p>
<p> Gross profit (billion roubles)	    182.1	  131.8</p>
<p> Net profit					133.4	   94.0</p>
<p> Turnover					  830.8	  592.7</p>
<p> Gross sales after VAT			 176.6	  141.7</p>
<p> Owed by debtors				  52.3	   31.4</p>
<p> Owed to creditors			     151.1	   84.4</p>
<p>Full name: OAO Torgovy Dom GUM.</p>
<p>A spokesman said full year results would be ready in the second half of February and that the annual shareholders meeting would take place at the end of April.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
